@startuml Arquitetura Híbrida Azure + HostGator
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Arquitetura Híbrida - Azure + HostGator

package "Internet" {
  [Usuários] as Users
}

package "Azure Cloud" {
  component [Azure App Service\nDjango Backend] as Django #0078D4
  component [Azure App Service\nFastAPI] as FastAPI #0078D4
  database [Azure Database\nPostgreSQL] as DB #336791
  component [SendGrid\nEmail Transacional] as SendGrid #1A82E2
  component [Azure DNS\nApp Domain] as AzureDNS #0078D4
}

package "HostGator" {
  component [HostGator DNS\nEmail Domain] as HostDNS #FF6600
  component [Email MX Records\nCaixas Corporativas] as EmailMX #FF6600
}

Users -->|HTTPS| AzureDNS
AzureDNS --> Django
AzureDNS --> FastAPI
Django --> DB
FastAPI --> DB
Django --> SendGrid
SendGrid -->|Deliver| Users

EmailMX ..>|Recebe| Users
HostDNS ..>|MX Records| EmailMX

note right of SendGrid
  SendGrid para envio
  transacional de convites
end note

note right of EmailMX
  HostGator apenas para
  emails corporativos
  (recebimento)
end note

@enduml

